  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch interface vs abstract class. Khi n\xE0o d\xF9ng c\xE1i
    n\xE0o trong Unity?"
  choices:
  - text: "Abstract class cho ph\xE9p c\xF3 implementation v\xE0 state, ch\u1EC9
      single inheritance. Interface ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh contract, m\u1ED9t class
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 implement nhi\u1EC1u interface. Trong Unity: d\xF9ng abstract
      class cho base component (Enemy, Weapon) c\xF3 shared behavior; d\xF9ng interface
      cho IInteractable, IDamageable \u0111\u1EC3 nhi\u1EC1u lo\u1EA1i object implement
      m\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa c\xF9ng base."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "V\xED d\u1EE5 c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 trong game context, hi\u1EC3u r\xF5
      trade-off."
  - text: "Interface kh\xF4ng c\xF3 code implementation, abstract class c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      c\xF3. T\xF4i hay d\xF9ng interface cho IInteractable."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Bi\u1EBFt kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m v\xE0 c\xF3 v\xED d\u1EE5 th\u1EF1c
      t\u1EBF."
  - text: "T\xF4i th\u01B0\u1EDDng d\xF9ng abstract class v\xEC n\xF3 linh ho\u1EA1t
      h\u01A1n."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Ch\u01B0a gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EF1 kh\xE1c
      bi\u1EC7t quan tr\u1ECDng."
  category: C#
